! XRT-08 RT04(IOL 17.15・据付・変更しない)= アクセスの P(BGP なし)。アクセスの IGP は IS-IS ACCESS(コアと別の領域)。
! アクセスの標準= LDP の ID は Lo0。
mpls label protocol ldp
mpls ldp router-id Loopback0 force
!
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.0.14 255.255.255.255
 ip router isis ACCESS
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description ACCESS-1 to XR01
 ip address 10.0.14.14 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis ACCESS
 isis network point-to-point
 isis metric 10
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description ACCESS-2 to RT05
 ip address 10.0.45.14 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis ACCESS
 isis network point-to-point
 isis metric 10
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
router isis ACCESS
 net 49.0002.0100.0000.0014.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 log-adjacency-changes
!
